# Backend API base URL.
#
# Used by the Fresh server (Deno) at request time. The server auto-loads
# `.env` from the cwd, so editing this file and restarting `deno task start`
# is enough to switch backends.
#
# The client bundle also reads the same constant. Fresh's browser polyfill
# makes `Deno.env.get()` return `undefined` in the browser, so client-side
# code falls through to the hardcoded production fallback in
# `lib/constants.ts`. In dev, the server's `.env` value takes precedence
# for SSR-rendered URLs (OAuth redirects, etc.) but client-side fetches
# still go to the production URL. To override the client bundle, set
# `API_BASE_URL` before building.
#
# Examples:
#   API_BASE_URL=https://projectflow-backend.engsiam.deno.net/api
#   API_BASE_URL=https://api.projectflow.dev/api
#   API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
API_BASE_URL=https://projectflow-backend.engsiam.deno.net/api
